{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想為親友送上生日祝福，卻常常錯過日子？Cakes 把聯絡人中已儲存的生日集合在同一個清爽畫面，讓你一眼看清誰的生日即將到來，適合重視人際關係、又不想費神記錄日期的用家。你可為主畫面加入海報式倒數小工具，生日當天更有蛋糕與燭光動畫迎接。程式不設帳戶、不作追蹤，生日資料只留在裝置內。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>自訂提醒與桌面倒數</h2>\n<p>Cakes 可為每個人設定提醒時間，由兩星期前至生日當天早上皆可選擇，重要親友可獲較長準備時間，其餘交由程式按預設節奏處理。主畫面海報式小工具以大型倒數顯示，生日當天會出現蛋糕與待吹熄的蠟燭，並可查看星座、誕生石與同日出生的名人。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-201-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-202-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-203-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-204-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-205-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-206-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Cakes: Birthday Calendar</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-12T16:18:19.451709+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":345,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}